{
  "_notes": [
    "The Walking Dead (v1.56, 2014, Stern).",
    "Stern SAM platform. ARM AT91 CPU, NVRAM at CPU 0x02100000.",
    "Scores are 4-byte little-endian integers.",
    "Score entry: 4-byte score at start, initials (+0x08 bytes) as null-terminated ch.",
    "Verified against NVRAM data with real scores.",
    "2026-06-27 automated twd_156 run independently verified Player 1 growth from 0 to 760,960 and game_over at 0x02110904 bit 0x40 (0xFF attract, 0x00 from Start through live scoring).",
    "SAM stores the 4 player scores as 4 x 8-byte (64-bit little-endian) fields: stride 8, not 4. The prior stride-4/length-4 layout mis-read players 2-4 (P2 read the zero high-bytes of P1, etc.). Corrected and validated against real 2-/3-/4-player Metallica dumps (mtl_180h)."
  ],
  "_fileformat": 0.8,
  "_metadata": {
    "version": 6,
    "copyright": [
